WEBVTT

00:55:28.538 --> 00:55:31.121
I can't wait to read it,
cannot wait to read it.

00:55:31.163 --> 00:55:33.163
Thank you, Cheryl Strayed.

00:55:33.204 --> 00:55:36.788
Thank you so much for joining me today.
And design matters.

00:55:36.913 --> 00:55:39.996
Such an open for so many wonderful
things to say.

00:55:40.329 --> 00:55:44.413
Thank you, Debbie. You are. You are a
woman after my own heart, I swear.

00:55:44.788 --> 00:55:48.913
We have to meet in real life someday.
Have sandwiches. Absolutely.

00:55:48.913 --> 00:55:50.954
I would love that. I would love that.

00:55:51.496 --> 00:55:55.954
Thank you, my dear. This is the 16th
year broadcasting design matters.

00:55:55.954 --> 00:55:57.454
And I'd like to thank you for listening.

00:55:57.788 --> 00:56:01.204
And remember, we can talk about making a
difference. We could make a difference.